sequenceDiagram
    actor Approver
    participant API as Invoice API
    participant DB as Azure SQL + outbox (proposed)
    participant Worker as Submission worker (proposed)
    participant Bus as Azure Service Bus (proposed)
    participant PayEx as PayEx (proposed)

    Approver->>API: Approve invoice
    API->>DB: Transaction: persist decision + audit + outbox item
    DB-->>API: Commit
    API-->>Approver: Approval recorded; provider submission pending
    Worker->>DB: Claim pending outbox item
    Worker->>Bus: Publish work (if topic is retained)
    Bus-->>Worker: Deliver work
    Worker->>PayEx: Submit with stable idempotency key
    alt Definite success
        PayEx-->>Worker: Success + provider reference
        Worker->>DB: Persist reference and completed status
    else Definite failure
        PayEx-->>Worker: Definite rejection
        Worker->>DB: Record failure / retry eligibility
    else Timeout or ambiguous response
        PayEx-->>Worker: Outcome unknown
        Worker->>DB: Record unknown outcome; do not blindly submit with a new key
        Note over Worker,PayEx: Retry same key if PayEx deduplicates; otherwise reconcile before resubmission
    end

    %% All DB/outbox/worker/Service Bus/PayEx elements are proposed, not implemented.
    %% Scenario and non-existence statement: ops/README.md and AGENTS.md.
